# A Spinloop whose engine-flag values reference environment variables, so one
# committed file works on every machine. `$FOO`, `${FOO}` and `${FOO:-default}`
# work in PARAM values and in preset entry values, resolved when
# `spinloop serve` or `spinloop cloud deploy` builds its command — parsing and
# exporting keep the raw text. See README.md.
PROVIDER llamacpp
ALIAS    qwen3.8-27b
CONTEXT  32768            # match the server's --ctx-size
PRESET   ./preset.ini     # values resolve as the preset is read; keys don't
PARAM    ngl = ${NGL:-99} # offload every layer unless NGL says otherwise
# ENV QUANT=UD-Q5_K_XL    # uncomment: deploy and a node wake apply the Spinloop's
                          # own ENV lines before they build, so an ENV line can
                          # supply what a PARAM or preset reference expands to
